  "content": "\u003cdiv class=\"field field-name-field-government\"\u003e\u003cdiv class=\"taxonomy-term taxonomy-term--type-government taxonomy-term--view-mode-strapline ds-1col clearfix\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n      \u003cem class=\"archive-indicator\"\u003e\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n    \n      \u003ctime class=\"meta meta__date\" datetime=\"\"\u003e\u003ctime datetime=\"1997-12-16T10:22:00Z\"\u003e16 December 1997\u003c/time\u003e\n\u003c/time\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n  \u003ch1 class=\"article__title\"\u003e\n  \u0026#34;No Foundation to Reports Housing NZ to be Sold to Tainui\u0026#34;\n\u003c/h1\u003e\n\n    \n            \u003cul class=\"meta--ministers\"\u003e\n            \u003cli\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n      \n        Doug Graham\n\n      \n  \n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/li\u003e\n      \n      \u003c/ul\u003e\n  \n\n    \n      \u003cem class=\"tag tag--portfolio\"\u003e\u003cspan class=\"is-archived\"\u003e\n\n  \n\n  \n    Housing\n\n\n\n\u003c/span\u003e\n\u003c/em\u003e\n      \n  \n\n\n            \u003cdiv class=\"prose field field--name-body field--type-text-with-summary field--label-hidden field--item\"\u003e\u003cp\u003eResponding to suggestions that Housing New Zealand might be sold to Tainui, Housing Minister Murray Mccully said today that \u0026#34;there was no foundation whatsoever to the reports\u0026#34;. \u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u0026#34;I have never received any such approach,\u0026#34; said Mr McCully, \u0026#34;nor would I ever entertain one.\u0026#34;\u003c/p\u003e\n\u003cp\u003e\u003cbr/\u003e\u003c/p\u003e\n\n\u003c/div\u003e\n      ",
  "content_text": "Responding to suggestions that Housing New Zealand might be sold to Tainui, Housing Minister Murray Mccully said today that \"there was no foundation whatsoever to the reports\". \"I have never received any such approach,\" said Mr McCully, \"nor would I ever entertain one.\"",
